WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.635
You join at sixty-three minutes. Harbor
lead one nil. But what changed? Between

00:00:04.635 --> 00:00:07.920
the Lines turns match events into a story
you can check.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.998
Four shots in the latest spell, after none
in the previous equal period. More

00:00:14.998 --> 00:00:20.321
attempts, not necessarily better chances.
This local preview uses fictional teams,

00:00:20.321 --> 00:00:21.100
with AI off.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.052
Choose Casual Viewer for everyday language,
Football Fan for named contributions,

00:00:27.052 --> 00:00:31.978
or Advanced Analysis for precise
comparisons. The facts and limits stay
shared.

00:00:31.978 --> 00:00:37.030
Catch Me Up also offers Quick or Full
recaps, independently of explanation level.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.829
What best describes this shot surge? The
app compares possible explanations with

00:00:42.829 --> 00:00:47.597
supporting events. Here, no single
explanation is established. It shows what
is

00:00:47.597 --> 00:00:49.770
known, and where the evidence stops.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.808
Now jump to seventy minutes. Has the
increase already faded? Yes. Shots rose
from

00:00:57.808 --> 00:01:02.676
one to four across the wider windows, but
fell from three to one within the latest

00:01:02.676 --> 00:01:06.060
spell. Both facts matter. Neither predicts
the next goal.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.522
Open the answer evidence. Replay the
fifty-nine-oh-nine shot and its build-up.

00:01:13.522 --> 00:01:18.103
These are recorded synthetic actions, not
broadcast footage or player tracking.

00:01:18.103 --> 00:01:20.770
The main match clock stays at seventy
minutes.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.618
Microsoft Foundry hosts GPT-five-point-four
Mini for optional structured answer

00:01:26.618 --> 00:01:31.295
selection and bounded evidence queries.
Application code computes and checks the

00:01:31.295 --> 00:01:33.400
facts, then renders the explanation.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:39.071
In this historical study, five model
answers matched deterministic baselines;
one

00:01:39.071 --> 00:01:43.578
case correctly needed no call. No optional
follow-ups were chosen. Added

00:01:43.578 --> 00:01:46.020
investigative benefit remains unproven.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.988
Viewer testing is pending. Current AI stays
off. Between the Lines: follow the

00:01:52.988 --> 00:01:54.970
story, then check the evidence.
